===Etymology===
From {{etyl|gmh|de}} {{term|āventiure|lang=gmh}}, borrowed from {{etyl|fro|de}} {{term|aventure|lang=fro}} and like the latter originally feminine. The neuter gender is from {{etyl|gml|de}}. 

